{"lang":"ko","dir":"ltr","title":"Napa Valley Nails Salon | 캘리포니아 나파 매니큐어, 페디큐어 &amp; 아크릴","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">본문으로 건너뛰기</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">NV</span><span>Napa Valley Nails Salon</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">소개</a><a href=\"#services\">서비스</a><a href=\"#faq\">자주 묻는 질문</a><a href=\"#gallery\">사진</a><a href=\"#reviews\">리뷰</a><a href=\"#visit\">영업시간 및 위치</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"언어\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\">Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\">中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\" selected>한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17072524551\">전화</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/salon-interior.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">네일숍 · 나파 Trancas St</p>\n    <h1>Napa Valley Nails Salon</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">Trancas Street에서 매니큐어, 페디큐어, 젤, 딥, 아크릴을. 단골손님들이 오랫동안 믿고 찾는 친절한 팀이 해 드립니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Napa+Valley+Nails+Salon/@38.3247587,-122.2902883,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x808506c02f40e403:0x46543d5ba4fd4849!8m2!3d38.3247587!4d-122.2902883!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.8 · Google 리뷰 69개<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17072524551\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> 전화로 예약</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%2C%20706%20Trancas%20St%2C%20Ste%20A%2C%20Napa%2C%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> 길찾기</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Napa+Valley+Nails+Salon/@38.3247587,-122.2902883,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x808506c02f40e403:0x46543d5ba4fd4849!8m2!3d38.3247587!4d-122.2902883!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">리뷰 69개, 평점 4.8★</a></li><li>예약 없이 방문 환영</li><li>매니큐어 &amp; 페디큐어</li><li>젤, 딥 &amp; 아크릴</li><li>네일 아트</li><li>신용카드 가능</li><li>전용 주차장</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">숍 소개</p><h2>깨끗하고, 친절하고, 편안하게.</h2><p>Napa Valley Nails Salon은 나파 706 Trancas Street에 있는 종합 네일숍으로, 여성과 남성 모두를 위해 매니큐어, 페디큐어, 젤, 딥 파우더, 아크릴, 연장, 네일 아트를 합니다.</p><p>저희 숍은 깨끗하고 위생적이며 색상이 아주 다양합니다. 단골손님들은 편안한 페디큐어, 발 마사지, 얇고 자연스러운 아크릴을 받으러 계속 찾아오십니다. 네일리스트로는 Ann, Lee, Joe, Kenny, Kevin, Kim이 있습니다.</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Napa+Valley+Nails+Salon/@38.3247587,-122.2902883,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x808506c02f40e403:0x46543d5ba4fd4849!8m2!3d38.3247587!4d-122.2902883!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.8★</b><span>리뷰 69개</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>Nextdoor</b><span>동네 인기 가게</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>주 6일</b><span>월–토 영업</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/red-manicure.jpg\" alt=\"막 완성한 빨간 매니큐어\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">메뉴</p><h2>서비스</h2></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>매니큐어</h3></div><p>클래식 매니큐어와 남성 매니큐어.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>페디큐어</h3></div><p>편안한 페디큐어와 발 마사지. 남성 페디큐어도 있어요.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>매니큐어 &amp; 페디큐어</h3></div><p>한 번 방문으로 둘 다.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>젤 네일</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>딥 파우더 네일</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">06</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>아크릴 네일</h3></div><p>얇고 자연스러운 아크릴. 이웃분들 말로는 3–4주 동안 들뜨지 않는대요.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">07</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>젤 네일 연장 &amp; 네일 연장</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">08</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>네일 아트</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">09</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>네일 폴리시</h3></div><p>고를 수 있는 색상이 아주 많습니다.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">10</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>왁싱</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">11</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>스킨 케어</h3></div></article></div><p class=\"note\">가격은 온라인에 올리지 않습니다. 현재 가격은 (707) 252-4551로 전화 주세요.</p></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">알아두세요</p><h2>알아 두세요</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>예약 없이 방문 환영</b><span>원하는 네일리스트가 있으면 미리 전화 주세요</span></li><li><b>신용카드 가능</b></li><li><b>전용 주차장</b></li><li><b>자전거 주차</b></li><li><b>성별 구분 없는 화장실</b></li><li><b>남성 서비스</b><span>남성 매니큐어와 페디큐어</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">갤러리</p><h2>최근 작업</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/gel-colors.jpg\" alt=\"멀티컬러 젤 매니큐어\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/red-nail-art.jpg\" alt=\"빨간 네일 아트 세트\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/silver-glitter.jpg\" alt=\"실버 글리터 네일\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/classic-red.jpg\" alt=\"클래식 빨간 매니큐어\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/lace-nails.jpg\" alt=\"긴 흰색 네일\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/lilac-gel.jpg\" alt=\"라일락 젤 네일\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/natural-nude.jpg\" alt=\"자연스러운 누드 매니큐어\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/lavender-nails.jpg\" alt=\"라벤더 매니큐어\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"press\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">수상 및 인정</p><h2>이웃이 뽑은 가게</h2></div><div class=\"press\"><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“NAPA Valley Nails is a Neighborhood Favorite in 1 neighborhood. It also won in 2020, 2022 and 2023.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Nextdoor Fave Awards</b> · Nextdoor Neighborhood Favorite · <a href=\"https://nextdoor.com/pages/napa-valley-nails-napa-ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">리뷰</p><h2>고객 후기</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.8</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 리뷰 69개</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Napa+Valley+Nails+Salon/@38.3247587,-122.2902883,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x808506c02f40e403:0x46543d5ba4fd4849!8m2!3d38.3247587!4d-122.2902883!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google에서 리뷰 더 보기 →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Love 💕 this nail salon. The team does a great job (just what I ask for) and are welcoming and can almost always fit me in at the last minute. Thank you Ann for years of service and friendship.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“The nail salon employees here are very nice, and take good care of your nails. They give great massages and are hygienic.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Aug 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“My wife and I both got a nice relaxing pedicure on vacation! I mean, when she uses that buffer kind of roughly, I&#39;m crawling up the back of the chair... But my feet feel so nice now! The foot massage was wonderful. Thank you!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Lee did an exceptional service, my feet are so clean, relaxed and painted! I’m so excited they look great! I’m falling asleep being so comfortable and relaxed I couldn’t help it!! I’m coming back for more !!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— BestProsInTown reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.bestprosintown.com/ca/napa/napa-valley-nails-salon-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BestProsInTown</a> · Jul 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“They did a wonderful job, charge very reasonably, and do a great acrylics.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jun 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Ann did my pedicure and my manicure! Not only did she do such a stunning job, she was so sweet and kind. I really enjoyed our time together and our little chats :) she’s an absolute doll and truly made my nail appointment an experience. Please please please go here and ask for her if she’s in! Calling ahead is a good idea to make sure she can take you. Thank you, Ann!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Mar 2023</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I have finally made Napa Valley Nails my place !! My experience has always been pleasurable. Anna is so sweet and does an amazing and detailed job.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2019</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I just went to this shop yesterday and will definitely be coming back! This place is so clean and carries a huge variety of colors to choose from. My nail tech Anna did an amazing job. She was very kind and pleasant to me. I absolutely love it here and will come back very soon.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jun 2019</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">자주 묻는 질문</p><h2>궁금한 점을 알려드려요</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>예약이 필요한가요?</summary><p>예약 없이 오셔도 되고, 갑자기 오셔도 거의 항상 해 드릴 수 있습니다. 원하는 네일리스트가 있으면 (707) 252-4551로 미리 전화 주세요.</p></details><details><summary>어떤 서비스를 하나요?</summary><p>매니큐어, 페디큐어, 젤 네일, 딥 파우더, 아크릴, 젤 및 일반 네일 연장, 네일 아트와 폴리시, 그리고 남성 매니큐어와 페디큐어. 왁싱과 스킨 케어도 서비스 목록에 있습니다.</p></details><details><summary>영업시간은 어떻게 되나요?</summary><p>월–금요일 오전 9:30–오후 6:30, 토요일 오전 9:30–오후 6시 영업합니다. 일요일은 쉽니다.</p></details><details><summary>어디에 있나요?</summary><p>706 Trancas St, Suite A, Napa, CA 94558에 있으며 전용 주차장이 있습니다.</p></details><details><summary>신용카드 받나요?</summary><p>네, 신용카드 받습니다.</p></details><details><summary>서비스 가격은 얼마인가요?</summary><p>가격은 온라인에 올리지 않지만 아주 합리적으로 받고 있습니다. 현재 가격은 (707) 252-4551로 전화 주세요.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">방문 안내</p>\n      <h2>영업시간 및 위치</h2>\n      <address>706 Trancas St, Ste A<br>Napa, CA 94558</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17072524551\">(707) 252-4551</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>월요일</td><td>9:30 AM – 6:30 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>화요일</td><td>9:30 AM – 6:30 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>수요일</td><td>9:30 AM – 6:30 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>목요일</td><td>9:30 AM – 6:30 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>금요일</td><td>9:30 AM – 6:30 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>토요일</td><td>9:30 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>일요일</td><td>휴무</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">예약 없이 방문 환영. 원하는 네일리스트가 있으면 전화로 예약하세요.</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/1144273802310676\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 8h3V4h-3a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2H8v4h2v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V8z\"/></svg><span>Facebook</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Napa+Valley+Nails+Salon/@38.3247587,-122.2902883,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x808506c02f40e403:0x46543d5ba4fd4849!8m2!3d38.3247587!4d-122.2902883!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.